{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Branch 是一款以逐行輸入自動生成心智圖的筆記工具，適合整理腦中零散想法、規劃目標與培養習慣的人；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-58.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>輸入即生成心智圖</h2>\n<p>逐行輸入想法，每行自動成為心智圖分支，顏色自動分配，也可拖動調整或切換大綱列表。你可選用目標、習慣、旅行或生活等範本，加入進度、連續紀錄及日程，並從鎖定畫面、小工具、Siri 與分享選單快速記錄，最後以圖片、PDF 或純文字分享。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-85-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-86-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-87-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-88-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-89-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-90-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Branch: Mind Map &amp; Notes</li><li>應用類別：Education</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/branch-mind-map-notes/id1631726575?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:41:29.544857+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T23:27:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:59:09.658271+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:38:36.185083+00:00","content_hash":"9db5d535a2da411d527e5d3456d6cb028f2723e462b43963ed31fd8a2b86d64b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}